            "review_title": "Review at Quan An Thanh Lich",
            "review_text": "BillTuckerUS\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam51 contributions\n0\nExcellent fresh seafood at very reasonable price\nApr 2019 • Family\nSeven of us stopped here. We ordered a variety of seafood-based dishes, including a spicy salad, a dish of vegetables, fried rice, etc., and ending with a seafood hotpot.\n\nThe highlight was the oysters; two apiece - total of 14, at VNDong 15,000 each (less than 75 cents ea.).\n\nTotal, about $50 for a delightful feast for seven people.\n\nService was also first class.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 28, 2019",
