            "review_text": "Mai H\n638 contributions\n1\nFresh and reasonable price of seafood.\nApr 2018 • Friends\nFresh seafood and quickly service. Cheap price for good quality of seafood, must try ray fish steam eat with rice noodle, vegetable wrap in rice paper and dip into their special fish sauce. But the restaurant is not too clean and very hot during the sunny day. Very crowded at weekend, try to avoid weekend if you would like to have a table and you should go with Vietnamese since they don't have any English menu or photo either.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 10, 2018",
